<title>PHILIPPINES: Lorenzo Shipping sets 15 centavos cash div.</title>
<headline>Lorenzo Shipping sets 15 centavos cash div.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lorenzo Shipping Corporation said on Wednesday it declared a 15 centavos cash dividend to shareholders on record May 15.</p>
<p>Fifty percent of the cash dividend is payable on June 16 and the balance is payable on July 17, the company said in a disclosure to the Philippine Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The disclosure did not say for what period the dividend was being paid. -- Manila newsroom (632) 841 8934</p>
</text>
